737	{"artifactId":"LLD-b7a68147dcf72034-s7","entry":{"id":"6d0810a755464324871576b570e3e1ce","actor":{"id":"insrc:approval","kind":"system","properties":{}},"timestamp":"2026-10-26T17:18:01.313Z","operation":"approve","revision":{"number":14,"contentHash":"be7bb97f2e0ccaa7e6cb1bd4be285f2448eb68d128323bebfb091ee2d2df1725"},"status":{"from":"draft","to":"approved"},"outcome":{"result":"override","summary":"User override after cycle 4 (3 review rounds). Round 3 had no HIGH findings; the 3 MED findings are misdescriptions of existing code (withFailureNet rethrows non-UnsafeArgError exceptions, runToolHooks takes unknown input and returns a readonly array, the gh auth probe keeps partial captured text). To be corrected in the build."}}}
